WEBVTT - Most Fascinating Stories - Episode 159: Theodore Roosevelt: The Youngest President and the Square Deal (1901–1904)

1
00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:05.600
[Rebecca] Welcome to Most Fascinating Stories.

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:06.800
